!\MODCOMMENTS: HEPTANE /OCTANE /TOLUENE /IC4H8 /C5H10 /C2H5OH AND DI-ISOBUTYLENE MECHANISMS TO PREDICT BOTH THE EVAPORATION AND CHEMICAL KINETICS
